# Declarative WiFi networks for the HITL rig, most-preferred first (higher
# `priority` wins). Referenced from BUILD.bazel via the sbc_application
# `wifi_config_file` arg; converted to JSON at build time and baked into the
# image (and applied by deploy_live).
#
# Copy this to `wifi.yaml` (gitignored) and fill in real credentials — the real
# file is never committed. Without it the rig bakes NO wifi profile, and
# `ensureProfiles` drops any profile a previous image left behind, which strands
# the rig after it's moved. Keep at least one always-reachable network here.
- ssid: YOUR_PRIMARY_SSID
  psk: YOUR_PRIMARY_PSK
  priority: 100
- ssid: YOUR_FALLBACK_SSID
  psk: YOUR_FALLBACK_PSK
  priority: 10
